WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.362
Now bring it all together in a one-page business plan.

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:08.521
Write your idea, the problem it solves, and who your customers are.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.117
Write what you sell, and your price.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.959
Add your costs, and how much money you need to start.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.195
Finish with your first three steps for the next month.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:28.872
Before you move on, check: Fill in each section of the plan. Use real cost numbers. List your first three steps. Submit your plan.

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:35.286
Well done. You have finished the course. Now write your one-page business plan.
